15:59:25 out   ## 5. Resize image — `_on_resize_w_changed` L1339–1353, `_on_resize_h_changed` L1355–1369, `_apply_resize` L1371–1392
15:59:25 out   With “link ratio” on:
15:59:25 out   ```
15:59:25 out   h = max(1, round(w * image_h / image_w))
15:59:25 out   w = max(1, round(h * image_w / image_h))
15:59:25 out   ```
15:59:25 out   Apply:
15:59:25 out   ```
15:59:25 out   nw = max(1, int(text_w))
15:59:25 out   nh = max(1, int(text_h))
15:59:25 out   if (nw, nh) == current size: “Suurus on juba sama”
15:59:25 out   push undo
15:59:25 out   image = image.resize((nw, nh), LANCZOS)
15:59:25 out   box = None
15:59:25 out   ```
15:59:25 out   Rust uses `resize_exact(..., Lanczos3)` so the colour mode is preserved like
15:59:25 out   PIL, and clears the box.
